<MainLayout title="Disclaimer">
  <h1 style="color: #2c3e50;">Disclaimer & Terms of Use</h1>
  
  <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #555; line-height: 1.8;">
    <p>
      <strong>1. Data Source and Ownership</strong><br />
      All metadata, abstracts, and titles provided on VisitLink are sourced dynamically from public APIs. We do not host, own, or store any full-text PDF documents on our servers. All copyrights belong to their respective publishers and authors.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>2. "As Is" Provision</strong><br />
      All data and outputs are provided strictly on an <b>"as is"</b> basis according to the original formatting from the source. We make no guarantees regarding the accuracy, completeness, or sequence of the metadata. 
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>3. Manual Processing Surcharge</strong><br />
      Any custom naming, manual sequence adjustments, or raw data reorganization requested by clients or resellers will be subject to an additional processing fee (typically 1-credit/file) due to the operational overhead involved.
    </p>
  </div>
</MainLayout>